ne                                                                                         | 210                                                                                          | (71.4)                                                                                       | 56                                                                                           | (75.7)                                                                                       | 52                                                                                           | (65.0)                                                                                       | 0.148                                                                                        | 43                                                                                           | (84.3)                                                                                       | 59                                                                                           | (66.3)                                                                                       | 0.021                                                                                        |\n| Number of acute organ dysfunction                                                            |                                                                                              |                                                                                              |                                                                                              |                                                                                              |                                                                                              |                                                                                              | 0.016                                                                                        |     