                                                                                          | (63.5)                                                                                       | 47                                                                                           | (63.5)                                                                                       | 47                                                                                           | (58.8)                                                                                       | 0.545                                                                                        | 38                                                                                           | (74.5)                                                                                       | 54                                                                                           | (61.4)                                                                                       | 0.114                                                                                        |\n| Liver                                                                                        | 116                                                                                          | (39.6)                                                                                       | 25                                                                                           | (33.8)                                                                                       | 31                                                                                           | (38.8)                                                                                       | 0.522                                                                                        | 18                                                                                           | (35.3