                        | 230                                                 | 32.7 (29.2-36.3)                                    |\n| 3                                                                                                        | 756                                                                                                      | 33.3                                                                                                     | 49                                                                                                       | 6.5 (4.8-8.5)                                                                                            | 297                                                 | 39.3 (35.8-42.9)                                    |\n| 4                                                                                                        | 398                                                                                                      | 17.5                                                                                                     | 47                                                                                                       | 11.8 (8.8-15.4)                                                                                          | 231                                                 | 58.0 (53.0-62.9)                                    |\n\n<!-- page: 6 -->\nTable 2  Crude and adjusted AUROCs for discrimination characteristics of SIRS, SOFA, PELOD-2 and qSOFA on ICU admission in patients &lt; 18 years with suspected or confirmed infection\n\n| Predictor     | Definition                     | Primary outcome: Hospital mortality   | Primary outcome: Hospital mortality   | Primary outcome: Hospital mortality   | Secondary outcome: mortality and/or ICU LOS ≥ 3 days   | Secondary outcome: mortality and/or ICU LOS ≥ 3 days   |\n|---------------|--------------------------------|------------------------------