:\"Park_2022\", mortality_rate_pct:35.1, n_predictor_models:0}}, {cohort_id:\"Park 2022  ICU sepsis due to IAI\", properties:{predictors_canonical:[], mortality_timepoint:\"28-day mortality\", population_description:\"Patients aged ≥19 years admitted to the ICU due to sepsis caused by intra-abdominal infection (IAI), including peritonitis caused by perforation of a hollow viscus, intra-abdominal abscess, biliary tract infection, pancreatic infection, enteritis, and colitis\", cohort_size_n:\"219\", cohort_label:\"ICU sepsis due to IAI\", paper_file_name:\"Park_2022\", mortality_rate_pct:28.8, n_predictor_models:0}}, {cohort_id:\"Ren 2022 MIMIC-III Total Cohort\", properties:{predictors_canonical:[\"heart_rate\", \"SAPSII\", \"SOFA\", \"multivariable_model\", \"blood_culture\", \"NLR\", \"TnT\", \"CRRT\", \"MV\", \"vasopressors\", \"organ_transplant\", \"cancer\", \"liver_disease\", \"renal_failure\", \"INR\", \"lactate\", \"creatinine\", \"BUN\", \"bicarbonate\", \"SpO2\", \"temperature\", \"MAP\", \"age\", \"fiberscope\", \"CVP\", \"pneumomycosis\", \"AIDS\", \"diabetes\", \"neurologic_disease\", \"COPD\", \"CHF\", \"pH\", \"glucose\", \"respiratory_rate\", \"sex\", \"MBP\", \"gender\", \"GCS\", \"albumin\", \"bilirubin\", \"WBC\", \"hemoglobin\", \"platelet\", \"APTT\", \"PT\", \"PO2\", \"PCO2\", \"oxygenation_index\", \"vasopressor_dose\", \"CVP_max\"], mortality_timepoint:\"In-Hospital Mortality\", population_description:\"ICU patients diagnosed with sepsis and lung infection; inclusion criteria: (1) entering the ICU for the first time, (2) diagnosed with sepsis and lung infection, (3) aged 18-80 years; exclusion criteria: (1) SOFA score < 2 and (2) stay of shorter than 24 h in the ICU; Sepsis 3.0 definition used (SOFA score ≥ 2)\", cohort_size_n:\"1676\", cohort_label:\"Total Cohort\", paper_file_name:\"Ren_2022\", mortality_rate_pct:28.9, n_predictor_models:136}}, {cohort_id:\"Ren 2022 MIMIC-III Training set\", properties:{predictors_canonical:[\"heart_rate\",