ar records of the first serum phosphate measured value; (3) patients who received phosphate supplementation during the ICU stay; (4) for patients with multiple records of ICU admission, excluding records other than the first ICU admission.\", cohort_size_n:\"27131\", cohort_label:\"Total Cohort\", paper_file_name:\"Chen_2021\", mortality_rate_pct:13.92, n_predictor_models:54}}, {cohort_id:\"Cao 2021  Screened cohort\", properties:{predictors_canonical:[\"septic_shock_prevalence\", \"sepsis_prevalence\"], population_description:\"All patients admitted to the comprehensive ICU of 7 tertiary hospitals in Sichuan from October 10, 2017 to January 9, 2018, after excluding 52 re-transfers and 362 patients who did not meet the eligibility criteria (expected ICU stay <24 h or age <18 years); screened for sepsis using Sepsis-3 criteria\", cohort_size_n:\"1604\", cohort_label:\"Screened cohort\", paper_file_name:\"Cao_2021\", n_predictor_models:2}}, {cohort_id:\"Cao 2021  Sepsis cohort\", properties:{predictors_canonical:[\"multivariable_model\", \"lung_infection\", \"APACHE_II\", \"lactate_max\", \"phosphorus_min\", \"CNS_dysfunction\", \"hospital_los\", \"icu_los\", \"mechanical_ventilation_time\", \"SOFA\", \"chronic_hepatic_insufficiency\", \"chronic_respiratory_insufficiency\", \"chronic_cardiac_insufficiency\", \"cerebrovascular_sequelae\", \"COPD\", \"hypertension\", \"chronic_renal_insufficiency\", \"autoimmune_diseases\", \"malignant_tumors\", \"diabetes\", \"coronary_heart_disease\", \"major_diseases_icu\", \"patient_sources\", \"household_registration\", \"sex_male\", \"age\"], mortality_timepoint:\"In-Hospital Mortality\", population_description:\"Patients admitted to the ICU of 7 tertiary hospitals in Sichuan diagnosed with sepsis according to Sepsis-3 criteria; patients expected to stay in the ICU <24 h or aged <18 years were excluded; for patients with repeated infections, only data related to the first sepsis event were collected\", cohort_size_n:\"294\", cohort_label:\"Sepsis cohort\", paper_file_name:\"Cao_2021\", mortality_rate_pct:57.5, n_predictor_models:45}}, {cohort_id:\"Cao 2021  Non-septic shock subgroup\", properties:{predictors_canonical:[\"abdomen_infection\", \"lung_infection\", \"cardiovascular_dysfunction\", \"liver_dysfunction\", \"coagulation_system_dysfunction\", \"respiratory_system_dysfunction\", \"number_acute_organ_dysfunction\", \"no_chronic_organ_dysfunction\", \"chronic_renal_insufficiency_organ\", \"immunosuppression\", \"chronic_hepatic_insufficiency\", \"chronic_respiratory_insufficiency\", \"chronic_cardiac_insufficiency\", \"other_underlying_disease\", \"cerebrovascular_sequelae\", \"COPD\", \"hypertension\", \"chronic_renal_insufficiency\", \"autoimmune_diseases\", \"malignant_tumors\", \"diabetes\", \"coronary_heart_disease\", \"no_underlying_disease\", \"major_diseases_ICU\", \"patient_sources\", \"household_registration\", \"sex\", \"age\"], mortality_timepoint:\"In-Hospital Mortality\", population_description:\"Patients diagnosed with sepsis according to Sepsis-3 criteria who did not meet septic shock criteria at the time of diagnosis\", cohort_size_n:\"154 (74 survival + 80 death, per Table 2)\", cohort_label:\"Non-septic shock subgroup\", paper_file_name:\"Cao_2021\", mortality_rate_pct:51.9, n_predictor_models:28}}, {cohort_id:\"Cao 2021  Septic shock subgroup\", properties:{predictors_canonical:[\"abdomen_infection\", \"lung_infection\", \"liver_organ_dysfunction\", \"coagulation_organ_dysfunction\", \"respiratory_organ_dysfunction\", \"number_acute_organ_dysfunction\", \"no_chronic_organ_dysfunction\", \"chronic_renal_insufficiency_organ\", \"immunosuppression\", \"chronic_hepatic_insufficiency\", \"chronic_respiratory_insufficiency\", \"chronic_cardiac_insufficiency\", \"other_underlying_diseases\", \"cerebrovascular_sequelae\", \"COPD\", \"hypertension\", \"chronic_renal_insufficiency\", \"autoimmune_diseases\", \"malignant_tumors\", \"diabetes\", \"coronary_heart_disease\", \"no_