iated with a reduced 30-day mortality. Specifically, for each 1% decrease in the PCT, CRP , and LAC levels, from baseline to M3, the odds of 30-day mortality decreased. This is reflected in the odds ratios of 0.948, 0.762, and 0.887, respectively.\", verifier_verdict:\"ok\", timing:\"Percentage change from baseline to 48-72 hours after admission (M3)\", is_significant:false, paper_file_name:\"Varga_2024\", anchor_page:6, effect_value:0.948, effect_type:\"OR\", cohort_id:\"Varga 2024  Total Cohort\", outcome_window_days:30, verifier_score:0.95, model_specification:\"Logistic regression including dynamic biomarker changes (PCT_Delta, CRP_Delta, LAC_Delta) alongside baseline clinical parameters\", predictor_canonical:\"PCT_delta\", outcome_type:\"mortality\", effect_size_str:\"OR: 0.948 (for each 1% decrease in PCT, odds of 30-day mortality decreased; 5.2% reduction in mortality odds per 1% decrease)\", anchor_section:\"3.6. Logistic Regression\", prompt_id:\"predictor_extract_v1@618f1f75\", outcome:\"30-day mortality\", anchor_bbox:\"null\"}}, {id:\"d3936cbc33a17f9f653b49ca\", properties:{predictors:\"LODS score\", extractor_model:\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6\", anchor_text:\"LODS near onset of suspected infection\", verifier_verdict:\"partial\", timing:\"Maximum score from 48 hours before to 24 hours after onset of infection\", is_significant:false, adjustment_kind:\"univariate\", paper_file_name:\"Seymour_2016\", anchor_page:6, effect_type:\"other\", cohort_id:\"Seymour 2016 UPMC Derivation ICU subset\", verifier_score:0.72, model_specification:\"Naive model, Descriptive characteristics of ICU encounters in UPMC derivation cohort, Univariate analysis\", predictor_canonical:\"LODS\", outcome_type:\"mortality\", effect_size_str:\"Mean (SD): 6.3 (3.9); Median (IQR): 6 (4-9)\", anchor_section:\"Table 3\", prompt_id:\"predictor_extract_v1@618f1f75\", outcome:\"In-hospital mortality\", anchor_bbox:\"null\"}}, {id:\"ee998d3452aa11239c9a5826\", properties:{predictors:\"MCV