mortality\", anchor_bbox:\"null\"}}, {id:\"4d88aea37bd9c48269dd20d9\", properties:{predictors:\"APACHE IV\", p_value:0.221, extractor_model:\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6\", anchor_text:\"SMRS was well-discriminated in the external validation set (AUC: 0.765), which was greater than APACHE IV and SAPS II (AUC: APACHE IV 0.754, SAPS II 0.751; Figure 2B ). However, no statistical significance of AUCs was observed (De Long method, SMRS vs. APACHE IV: P -value 0.221; SMRS vs. SAPS II: P -value 0.177).\", verifier_verdict:\"ok\", timing:\"During the first 24 h of ICU admission\", is_significant:false, paper_file_name:\"Zhang_2021\", effect_value:0.754, anchor_page:4, effect_type:\"AUC\", cohort_id:\"Zhang 2021 eICU Validation set\", auc:0.754, outcome_window_days:30, verifier_score:0.95, model_specification:\"ROC analysis, APACHE IV score performance in external validation set\", predictor_canonical:\"APACHE_IV\", outcome_type:\"mortality\", effect_size_str:\"AUC: 0.754; SMRS vs. APACHE IV P-value 0.221\", anchor_section:\"Model Performance\", prompt_id:\"predictor_extract_v1@618f1f75\", outcome:\"30-day mortality\", anchor_bbox:\"null\"}}, {id:\"127c58b18c4f718eae6ec3cb\", properties:{predictors:\"LDH, age, gender, ethnicity, potassium, calcium, albumin, hemoglobin, alkaline phosphatase, vasopressor, Elixhauser score, respiratory failure\", extractor_model:\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6\", anchor_text:\"LDH-model | Training set | 0.530 | 0.761 (0.732- 0.791) | 0.662 (0.624- 0.700) | 0.747 (0.717- 0.777) | 0.679 (0.641- 0.716) | 0.773 (0.748- 0.798) | 0.718 (0.695- 0.742)\", is_significant:false, auc_ci_hi:0.798, auc_ci_lo:0.748, verifier_score:0.98, model_specification:\"Multivariable logistic regression combining LDH, age, gender, ethnicity, potassium, calcium, albumin, hemoglobin, alkaline phosphatase, vasopressor, Elixhauser score, respiratory failure (LDH-model, Training set)\", predictor_canonical:\"multivariable_model\", ci_lo:0.748, anchor_section:\"Table 3\", ci_h