 CI: 0.716 to 0.870, P =0.000); the SOFA score + the presepsin level (purple line): 0.817 (95% CI: 0.742 to 0.892, P =0.000). The AUC value of a combination of the SOFA score and the presepsin level is signi fi cantly larger than that of the SOFA score alone in predicting patients ' in-hospital mortality from sepsis (AUC: 0.817 vs 0.793, P =0.041).\", is_significant:true, auc_ci_hi:0.892, auc_ci_lo:0.742, verifier_score:1.0, model_specification:\"ROC curve analysis — combined model (SOFA score + presepsin level)\", predictor_canonical:\"multivariable_model\", ci_lo:0.742, anchor_section:\"Discussion\", ci_hi:0.892, outcome:\"In-hospital mortality\", anchor_bbox:\"null\", p_value:0.0, verifier_verdict:\"ok\", timing:\"Upon admission\", paper_file_name:\"Wen_2019\", effect_value:0.817, anchor_page:4, effect_type:\"AUC\", cohort_id:\"Wen 2019  Total Cohort\", auc:0.817, outcome_type:\"mortality\", effect_size_str:\"AUC =0.817 (95% CI: 0.742 to 0.892), P=0.000; significantly larger than SOFA score alone (AUC: 0.817 vs 0.793, P=0.041)\", prompt_id:\"predictor_extract_v1@618f1f75\"}}, {id:\"4bd419d0030d287da1e78581\", properties:{predictors:\"Need mechanical ventilation, n\", p_value:0.001, extractor_model:\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6\", anchor_text:\"Need mechanical ventilation, n | 2,638 (48.5) | 2,080 (45.9) | 558 (61.5) | < 0.001\", verifier_verdict:\"ok\", timing:\"Within 24 hours of ICU admission\", is_significant:true, adjustment_kind:\"univariate\", paper_file_name:\"Zhang_2021\", anchor_page:3, effect_type:\"other\", cohort_id:\"Zhang 2021 MIMIC III Development set\", outcome_window_days:30, verifier_score:0.95, model_specification:\"Naive model, Comparison of survivors vs non-survivors (Chi-square), Univariate analysis\", predictor_canonical:\"mechanical_ventilation\", outcome_type:\"mortality\", effect_size_str:\"Survivors: 2,080 (45.9) vs Non-survivors: 558 (61.5), p<0.001\", anchor_section:\"TABLE 1 | Baseline characteristics of participants in development s