0.81, outcome:\"ICU mortality\", anchor_bbox:\"null\"}}, {id:\"5cacd975e7759b933fab6770\", properties:{predictors:\"30 mL/kg initial fluid resuscitation during first 3 hours\", extractor_model:\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6\", anchor_text:\"Achieving the resuscitation goal of 30 ml/kg during the first 3 h (OR 0.43, 95% CI, 0.30-0.63) and administering antibiotics within 1 h (OR 0.65, 95% CI, 0.46-0.92) of the onset of septic shock decreased the odds ratio for mortality in patients with septic shock ( Table 7 ).\", verifier_verdict:\"ok\", timing:\"Within first 3 hours of septic shock onset\", is_significant:true, adjustment_kind:\"multivariate\", paper_file_name:\"Wang_2020\", anchor_page:5, effect_value:0.43, effect_type:\"OR\", cohort_id:\"Wang 2020 CCCST Total Cohort\", verifier_score:1.0, model_specification:\"Multivariable stepwise logistic regression adjusted for age, APACHE II score, SOFA-initial score, comorbid cardiovascular diseases, hypertension, diabetes mellitus and chronic renal failure, use of MV, RRT and vasopressors, administration of antibiotics within 1h, and 30 mL/kg fluid resuscitation within the first 3h (Table 7, septic shock subgroup)\", predictor_canonical:\"fluid_resuscitation_30ml_kg\", ci_lo:0.3, outcome_type:\"mortality\", effect_size_str:\"OR 0.43 (95% CI 0.30-0.63)\", anchor_section:\"Factors Associated With Mortality in All Patients With Sepsis\", prompt_id:\"predictor_extract_v1@618f1f75\", ci_hi:0.63, outcome:\"ICU mortality\", anchor_bbox:\"null\"}}, {id:\"b3ac8a43b17d48063b95430f\", properties:{predictors:\"Antibiotics within 1 hour of septic shock onset\", extractor_model:\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6\", anchor_text:\"Achieving the resuscitation goal of 30 ml/kg during the first 3 h (OR 0.43, 95% CI, 0.30-0.63) and administering antibiotics within 1 h (OR 0.65, 95% CI, 0.46-0.92) of the onset of septic shock decreased the odds ratio for mortality in patients with septic shock ( Table 7 ).\", verifier_verdict:\"ok\", timing:\"Withi