           | (9.8)           | 17             | (19.1)         | 0.146          |\n| Diabetes                                              | 60             | (20.4)         | 18              | (24.3)          | 19           | (25.6)       | 0.934 | 6               | (11.8)          | 17             | (19.1)         | 0.260          |\n| Malignant tumors                                      | 22             | (7.5)          | 4               | (5.4)           | 5            | (6.3)        | 1.000 | 3               | (5.9)           | 10             | (11.2)         | 0.455          |\n| Autoimmune diseases                                   | 11             | (3.7)          | 2               | (27)            | 7            | (8.8)        | 0.210 | 2               | (3.9)           | 0              | (0)            | 0.131          |\n| Chronic renal insufficiency and failure               | 18             | (6.1)          | 6               | (8.1)           | 7            | (8.8)        | 0.886 | 1               | (2.0)           | 4              | (4.5)          | 0.761          |\n| Hypertension                                          | 95             | (32.3)         | 22              | (29.7)          | 35           | (43.8)       | 0.072 | 8               | (15.7)          | 30             | (33.7)         | 0.021          |\n| Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease                 | 34             | (11.6)         | 10              | (13.5)          | 11           | (13.8)       | 0.966 | 2               | (3.9)           | 11             | (12.4)         | 0.176          |\n| Sequelae of cerebrovascular accident                  | 18             | (6.1)          | 3               | (4.1)           | 8            | (10.0)       | 0.152 | 3               | (5.9)           | 4              | (4.5)          | 1.000          |\n| Other                                                 | 65             | (22.1)         | 14              | (18.9)          | 16         