volvement system (scored by sequential organ failure score (SOFA)) |\n| Respiratory system                                                                           | 282                                                                                          | (96.2)                                                                                       | 67                                                                                           | (90.5)                                                                                       | 79                                                                                           | (98.8)                                                                                       | 0.054                                                                                        | 49                                                                                           | (96.1)                                                                                       | 87                                                                                           | (98.9)                                                                                       | 0.629                                                                                        |\n| Coagulation system                                                                           | 186                                                                                          | (63.5)                                                                                       | 47                                                                                           | (63.5)                                                                                       | 47                                                                                           | (58.8)                                                                                       | 0.545                    