ions                                                                 | 47                                                                                           | (16)                                                                                         | 14                                                                                           | (18.9)                                                                                       | 17                                                                                           | (21.2)                                                                                       |                                                                                              | 5                                                                                            | (9.8)                                                                                        | 11                                                                                           | (12.4)                                                                                       |                                                                                              |\n\n<!-- page: 6 -->\nTable 3. Comparison of mortality rate in patients with different infection sites between non-septic shock and septic shock groups.\n\n|                        | Non-septic shock   | Non-septic shock   | Non-septic shock   | Septic shock   | Septic shock   | Septic shock   |     P |\n|------------------------|--------------------|--------------------|--------------------|----------------|----------------|----------------|-------|\n|                        | N                  | Death, n (%)       | Death, n (%)       | N              | Death, n (%)   | Death, n (%)   |       |\n| Lung                   | 113                | 65                 | (57.5)             | 78             | 58             | (74.4)         | 0.017 |\n| Abdomen                | 41     